# How to cite PhysKit. The author list matches the paper's. GitHub shows this file as "Cite this
# repository"; Zenodo reads it when it archives a release. The version is deliberately absent: each
# tagged release is the version, and its Zenodo DOI pins it.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PhysKit, please cite the paper below and the version of PhysKit you used.
type: software
title: "PhysKit"
authors:
